id: pm-5cgm2z
title: Evaluate @toon-format/toon 4 compatibility and item-format migration
description: "Own the TOON 4.0.0 major upgrade separately from routine dependency refreshes. Upstream declares no Node engine floor, but the major storage codec must prove byte-level item/history compatibility, strict decode/encode behavior, migration safety, and all release gates before adoption."
type: Chore
status: open
priority: 3
tags[4]: dependencies,migration,storage,toon
created_at: "2026-07-26T08:28:30.602Z"
updated_at: "2026-07-26T18:31:22.352Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 300
acceptance_criteria: TOON 4 is evaluated against canonical item files and history replay; encode/decode and migration fixtures remain lossless; Node 22/24/26 and Bun installed consumers pass; the upgrade is adopted or explicitly rejected with upstream evidence.
parent: pm-u9d0
risk: medium
confidence: medium
